---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Women Internships">
  <div class="py-8">
    <div class="mb-6 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight">Women Internships</h1>
      <h2 class="text-lg md:text-3xl font-light text-gray-700">
        Training and up-skilling women from under-represented communities
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
      <div class="flex-grow max-w-5xl">
        <section class="space-y-4 mb-12">
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
            <img
              src="/media/programs/banner_1.jpg"
              alt="KP Women Civic Internship"
              class="w-full h-auto"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 flex flex-col justify-end p-4 md:p-8 text-white">
              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-semibold">KP Women Civic Internship</h3>
              <p class="text-sm md:text-lg mt-2">Breaking barriers for a more inclusive workspace for women</p>
              <div>
                <span class="inline-block mt-4 px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded">Applications Open!</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="font-semibold">
            Our internship programs are designed to support women’s empowerment and
            inclusion in the digital economy.
          </p>
          <p>
            In Pakistan, particularly in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, women face significant
            challenges in breaking through barriers to succeed in male-dominated
            workspaces. Issues such as mobility constraints, remote locations, and limited
            agency in decision-making contribute to their struggles in securing
            employment. According to a World Bank report on women’s workforce
            participation, “85 percent of working-age women in Peshawar believe that women
            should work for pay, but only 7.6 percent of women can freely decide to work
            for pay outside the house.”
          </p>
          <p>
            Additionally, a diversity and inclusion report shared by P@SHA highlights that
            women make up only 16% of the workforce in Pakistan, prompting concerns and
            necessitating prompt responses from relevant authorities.
          </p>
          <p>
            Recognizing these challenges, Code for Pakistan, with support from its program
            partners, initiated women-focused internship programs. Through these programs,
            women interns acquire technical skills, gaining hands-on experience working on
            government projects and participating in an agile development and deployment
            process. Our interns receive one-on-one mentorship, access to female role
            models, and opportunities to establish industry connections crucial for their
            transition into the digital workplace.
          </p>
          <p>
            The program curriculum is tailored to empower interns for the next stage of
            their careers, offering a unique learning experience with blended approaches,
            combining online resources with practical hands-on projects. The programs also
            provide personalized mentorship and career counseling from industry
            professionals, ensuring interns receive expert guidance and support throughout
            their journey. Furthermore, interns have the opportunity to enhance their
            technical and soft skills through a comprehensive learning curriculum.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 space-y-6">
          <h3 class="heading">KP Women Civic Internship</h3>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6 items-center">
            <img
              src="/media/programs/logo.png"
              alt="KP Women Program Logo"
              class="w-32 md:w-40"
            />
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
              <h4 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold">Creating opportunities for women in under-served areas of KP</h4>
              <p>
                The KP Women Civic Digital Internship is a six-month remote program in
                partnership with the
                <a
                  class="link"
                  href="https://www.kpitb.gov.pk/digital-skills"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  >Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Information Technology Board</a
                >, for women graduates offering tech skills and hands-on experience in
                Information Technology.
              </p>
              <p>
                Interns work on digital solutions to improve public service and citizen
                engagement, through self-paced learning, online mentorship, and real-world
                projects with government departments.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">97%</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Graduation Rate</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">65</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Speaker Sessions</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">60%</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Employment Rate</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">56</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">Women Upskilled</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <div class="relative w-full" style="padding-bottom: 56.25%;">
              <iframe
                class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full rounded"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/87ZP-UD8f-k?si=fqzNHhTdZIOdovYb"
                title="KP Women Civic Internship"
                frameborder="0"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="heading">What we offer</h3>
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-6 items-center">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>
                Monthly stipends, personalised one-on-one mentorship, and exclusive
                speaker sessions with top industry experts.
              </li>
              <li>
                Hands-on experience of working alongside Fellows on impactful Civic Tech
                and GovTech projects.
              </li>
              <li>
                Tailored information sessions on the latest industry trends in an evolving
                tech space.
              </li>
              <li>Career counselling and job fairs to connect with potential employers.</li>
            </ul>
            <img
              src="/media/programs/stamp.jpg"
              alt="Program stamp"
              class="w-48 md:w-64 rounded"
            />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="heading">Learning Tracks</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-3">Web Development</div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-3">Artificial Intelligence</div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-3">Front-end Design</div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-3">UI/UX Design</div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-3">Mobile Development</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="heading">Testimonials from our interns</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <article class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <img
                src="/media/programs/bisma.jpg"
                alt="Bisma"
                class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded mb-3"
              />
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                “The skills and experience I gained during the internship opened up so
                many new work opportunities. Working on real projects alongside industry
                professionals and government departments strengthened my portfolio and
                connected me with potential clients.”
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">— Bisma</p>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <img
                src="/media/programs/shahirah.jpg"
                alt="Shahirah"
                class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded mb-3"
              />
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                “The KP Women Civic Digital Internship greatly boosted my confidence,
                allowing me to apply and expand my skills in a supportive environment.”
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">— Shahirah</p>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <img
                src="/media/programs/pakeeza.jpg"
                alt="Pakeeza"
                class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded mb-3"
              />
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                “The one-on-one mentorship during the internship was invaluable. This
                internship helped me grow both professionally and broaden my technical
                knowledge in meaningful ways.”
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">— Pakeeza</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="heading">How can you help?</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded">
              <img
                src="/media/programs/speaker.png"
                alt="Become a Speaker"
                class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/35 text-white p-4 flex flex-col justify-end">
                <h4 class="font-semibold">Become a Speaker</h4>
                <p class="text-sm mt-2">Volunteer to speak with the interns to guide and advise them.</p>
                <a class="inline-block mt-3 px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-900 rounded" href="mailto:internship@codeforpakistan.org">Get Involved</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded">
              <img
                src="/media/programs/mentor.jpg"
                alt="Become a Mentor"
                class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/35 text-white p-4 flex flex-col justify-end">
                <h4 class="font-semibold">Become a Mentor</h4>
                <p class="text-sm mt-2">Guide and advise the interns towards realizing their full potential.</p>
                <a class="inline-block mt-3 px-4 py-2 bg-white text-gray-900 rounded" href="mailto:internship@codeforpakistan.org">Get Involved</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Learn more about this specific program:
            <a
              class="link"
              href="/programs/internships/kp-women"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >KP Women Civic Internship</a
            >
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
